380
00:31:45,237 --> 00:31:48,990
Pozuje do zdjęć w stylu pin-up.

381
00:31:49,449 --> 00:31:51,076
Masz kłopoty finansowe?

382
00:31:51,201 --> 00:31:53,120
- Ja?
- Ty.

383
00:31:53,370 --> 00:31:56,832
