409
00:33:18,830 --> 00:33:21,208
Tego piątku? Sto tysięcy?

410
00:33:21,374 --> 00:33:22,667
Do tego piątku.

411
00:33:23,335 --> 00:33:26,755
Żebym znów ci zaufał.

412
00:33:33,762 --> 00:33:36,348
Spoko. Masz moje słowo.

413
00:33:36,973 --> 00:33:38,183
To do piątku.

414
00:33:38,350 --> 00:33:39,935
